{
  "uid": "sa-operacion",
  "title": "Operación — SA Platform (4 señales de oro)",
  "tags": [
    "p10",
    "slo"
  ],
  "timezone": "browser",
  "schemaVersion": 39,
  "version": 1,
  "refresh": "30s",
  "time": {
    "from": "now-1h",
    "to": "now"
  },
  "editable": true,
  "description": "Fila 1 responde '¿cumplimos?'; filas 2-5 responden '¿que esta fallando y por que?' (latencia, trafico, errores, saturacion). Ultima fila: del sintoma al registro.",
  "panels": [
    {
      "type": "row",
      "title": "1 · ¿Cumplimos lo que prometemos a los usuarios? (SLO)",
      "collapsed": false,
      "gridPos": {
        "h": 1,
        "w": 24,
        "x": 0,
        "y": 0
      },
      "id": 1,
      "panels": []
    },
    {
      "type": "stat",
      "title": "Disponibilidad (5 min)",
      "description": "SLO 99.5 % de peticiones sin 5xx. Rojo = por debajo del objetivo ahora.",
      "id": 2,
      "datasource": {
        "type": "prometheus",
        "uid": "prometheus"
      },
      "gridPos": {
        "h": 4,
        "w": 6,
        "x": 0,
        "y": 1
      },
      "targets": [
        {
          "expr": "sli:disponibilidad:ratio_rate5m",
          "refId": "A",
          "datasource": {
            "type": "prometheus",
            "uid": "prometheus"
          }
        }
      ],
      "fieldConfig": {
        "defaults": {
          "unit": "percentunit",
          "thresholds": {
            "mode": "absolute",
            "steps": [
              {
                "color": "red",
                "value": null
              },
              {
                "color": "green",
                "value": 0.995
              }
            ]
          },
          "decimals": 2
        },
        "overrides": []
      },
      "options": {
        "colorMode": "background",
        "graphMode": "none",
        "reduceOptions": {
          "calcs": [
            "lastNotNull"
          ]
        }
      }
    },
    {
      "type": "stat",
      "title": "Latencia ≤ 500 ms (5 min)",
      "description": "SLO 95 % de peticiones en 500 ms o menos.",
      "id": 3,
      "datasource": {
        "type": "prometheus",
        "uid": "prometheus"
      },
      "gridPos": {
        "h": 4,
        "w": 6,
        "x": 6,
        "y": 1
      },
      "targets": [
        {
          "expr": "sli:latencia:ratio_rate5m",
          "refId": "A",
          "datasource": {
            "type": "prometheus",
            "uid": "prometheus"
          }
        }
      ],
      "fieldConfig": {
        "defaults": {
          "unit": "percentunit",
          "thresholds": {
            "mode": "absolute",
            "steps": [
              {
                "color": "red",
                "value": null
              },
              {
                "color": "green",
                "value": 0.95
              }
            ]
          },
          "decimals": 1
        },
        "overrides": []
      },
      "options": {
        "colorMode": "background",
        "graphMode": "none",
        "reduceOptions": {
          "calcs": [
            "lastNotNull"
          ]
        }
      }
    },
    {
      "type": "stat",
      "title": "Presupuesto de error restante (30 d, disponibilidad)",
      "description": "Cuanto margen queda antes de incumplir el SLO mensual. 0 % = presupuesto agotado.",
      "id": 4,
      "datasource": {
        "type": "prometheus",
        "uid": "prometheus"
      },
      "gridPos": {
        "h": 4,
        "w": 6,
        "x": 12,
        "y": 1
      },
      "targets": [
        {
          "expr": "slo:disponibilidad:error_budget_remaining:ratio30d",
          "refId": "A",
          "datasource": {
            "type": "prometheus",
            "uid": "prometheus"
          }
        }
      ],
      "fieldConfig": {
        "defaults": {
          "unit": "percentunit",
          "thresholds": {
            "mode": "absolute",
            "steps": [
              {
                "color": "red",
                "value": null
              },
              {
                "color": "orange",
                "value": 0.25
              },
              {
                "color": "green",
                "value": 0.5
              }
            ]
          },
          "decimals": 1
        },
        "overrides": []
      },
      "options": {
        "colorMode": "background",
        "graphMode": "none",
        "reduceOptions": {
          "calcs": [
            "lastNotNull"
          ]
        }
      }
    },
    {
      "type": "stat",
      "title": "Burn rate 1 h (peor de los dos SLO)",
      "description": ">14.4 dispara pagina; >6 sostenido dispara ticket. 1 = consumo exactamente al ritmo permitido.",
      "id": 5,
      "datasource": {
        "type": "prometheus",
        "uid": "prometheus"
      },
      "gridPos": {
        "h": 4,
        "w": 6,
        "x": 18,
        "y": 1
      },
      "targets": [
        {
          "expr": "max(label_replace(slo:disponibilidad:burn_rate1h, \"slo\", \"disp\", \"\", \"\") or label_replace(slo:latencia:burn_rate1h, \"slo\", \"lat\", \"\", \"\"))",
          "refId": "A",
          "datasource": {
            "type": "prometheus",
            "uid": "prometheus"
          }
        }
      ],
      "fieldConfig": {
        "defaults": {
          "unit": "none",
          "thresholds": {
            "mode": "absolute",
            "steps": [
              {
                "color": "green",
                "value": null
              },
              {
                "color": "orange",
                "value": 6
              },
              {
                "color": "red",
                "value": 14.4
              }
            ]
          },
          "decimals": 1
        },
        "overrides": []
      },
      "options": {
        "colorMode": "background",
        "graphMode": "none",
        "reduceOptions": {
          "calcs": [
            "lastNotNull"
          ]
        }
      }
    },
    {
      "type": "row",
      "title": "2 · Latencia — ¿qué tan lento lo perciben?",
      "collapsed": false,
      "gridPos": {
        "h": 1,
        "w": 24,
        "x": 0,
        "y": 5
      },
      "id": 6,
      "panels": []
    },
    {
      "type": "timeseries",
      "title": "Latencia p95 por servicio",
      "description": "Linea roja = umbral del SLO (500 ms). Si el gateway sube y un servicio interno tambien, la causa esta aguas abajo: abra una traza.",
      "id": 7,
      "datasource": {
        "type": "prometheus",
        "uid": "prometheus"
      },
      "gridPos": {
        "h": 8,
        "w": 12,
        "x": 0,
        "y": 6
      },
      "targets": [
        {
          "expr": "histogram_quantile(0.95, sum by (le, app) (rate(http_request_duration_seconds_bucket{namespace=\"sa-p8\",app=~\"api-gateway|auth|solicitudes\",route!~\"/health.*|/metrics\"}[5m])))",
          "legendFormat": "p95 {{app}}",
          "refId": "A",
          "datasource": {
            "type": "prometheus",
            "uid": "prometheus"
          }
        },
        {
          "expr": "histogram_quantile(0.99, sum by (le, app) (rate(http_request_duration_seconds_bucket{namespace=\"sa-p8\",app=~\"api-gateway|auth|solicitudes\",route!~\"/health.*|/metrics\"}[5m])))",
          "legendFormat": "p99 {{app}}",
          "refId": "B",
          "datasource": {
            "type": "prometheus",
            "uid": "prometheus"
          }
        },
        {
          "expr": "vector(0.5)",
          "legendFormat": "umbral SLO",
          "refId": "C",
          "datasource": {
            "type": "prometheus",
            "uid": "prometheus"
          }
        }
      ],
      "fieldConfig": {
        "defaults": {
          "unit": "s",
          "custom": {
            "lineWidth": 2,
            "fillOpacity": 8
          },
          "min": 0
        },
        "overrides": []
      },
      "options": {
        "legend": {
          "displayMode": "table",
          "placement": "bottom",
          "calcs": [
            "lastNotNull",
            "max"
          ]
        },
        "tooltip": {
          "mode": "multi"
        }
      }
    },
    {
      "type": "timeseries",
      "title": "Peticiones por encima de 500 ms",
      "description": "Fraccion de peticiones lentas por servicio (lo que consume el presupuesto de latencia).",
      "id": 8,
      "datasource": {
        "type": "prometheus",
        "uid": "prometheus"
      },
      "gridPos": {
        "h": 8,
        "w": 12,
        "x": 12,
        "y": 6
      },
      "targets": [
        {
          "expr": "1 - (sum by (app) (rate(http_request_duration_seconds_bucket{namespace=\"sa-p8\",app=~\"api-gateway|auth|solicitudes\",route!~\"/health.*|/metrics\",le=\"0.5\"}[5m])) / sum by (app) (rate(http_request_duration_seconds_count{namespace=\"sa-p8\",app=~\"api-gateway|auth|solicitudes\",route!~\"/health.*|/metrics\"}[5m])))",
          "legendFormat": "{{app}}",
          "refId": "A",
          "datasource": {
            "type": "prometheus",
            "uid": "prometheus"
          }
        }
      ],
      "fieldConfig": {
        "defaults": {
          "unit": "percentunit",
          "custom": {
            "lineWidth": 2,
            "fillOpacity": 8
          },
          "min": 0
        },
        "overrides": []
      },
      "options": {
        "legend": {
          "displayMode": "table",
          "placement": "bottom",
          "calcs": [
            "lastNotNull",
            "max"
          ]
        },
        "tooltip": {
          "mode": "multi"
        }
      }
    },
    {
      "type": "row",
      "title": "3 · Tráfico — ¿cuánto y qué hacen los usuarios?",
      "collapsed": false,
      "gridPos": {
        "h": 1,
        "w": 24,
        "x": 0,
        "y": 14
      },
      "id": 9,
      "panels": []
    },
    {
      "type": "timeseries",
      "title": "Peticiones por segundo",
      "description": "Una caida abrupta de trafico tambien es una falla (nadie puede entrar).",
      "id": 10,
      "datasource": {
        "type": "prometheus",
        "uid": "prometheus"
      },
      "gridPos": {
        "h": 8,
        "w": 8,
        "x": 0,
        "y": 15
      },
      "targets": [
        {
          "expr": "sum by (app) (rate(http_requests_total{namespace=\"sa-p8\",app=~\"api-gateway|auth|solicitudes\",route!~\"/health.*|/metrics\"}[1m]))",
          "legendFormat": "{{app}}",
          "refId": "A",
          "datasource": {
            "type": "prometheus",
            "uid": "prometheus"
          }
        }
      ],
      "fieldConfig": {
        "defaults": {
          "unit": "reqps",
          "custom": {
            "lineWidth": 2,
            "fillOpacity": 8
          },
          "min": 0
        },
        "overrides": []
      },
      "options": {
        "legend": {
          "displayMode": "table",
          "placement": "bottom",
          "calcs": [
            "lastNotNull",
            "max"
          ]
        },
        "tooltip": {
          "mode": "multi"
        }
      }
    },
    {
      "type": "timeseries",
      "title": "Negocio: solicitudes creadas / min",
      "description": "Metrica de negocio: cuantas solicitudes completan los usuarios.",
      "id": 11,
      "datasource": {
        "type": "prometheus",
        "uid": "prometheus"
      },
      "gridPos": {
        "h": 8,
        "w": 8,
        "x": 8,
        "y": 15
      },
      "targets": [
        {
          "expr": "sum(rate(solicitudes_creadas_total{namespace=\"sa-p8\"}[5m])) * 60",
          "legendFormat": "solicitudes/min",
          "refId": "A",
          "datasource": {
            "type": "prometheus",
            "uid": "prometheus"
          }
        }
      ],
      "fieldConfig": {
        "defaults": {
          "unit": "none",
          "custom": {
            "lineWidth": 2,
            "fillOpacity": 8
          },
          "min": 0
        },
        "overrides": []
      },
      "options": {
        "legend": {
          "displayMode": "table",
          "placement": "bottom",
          "calcs": [
            "lastNotNull",
            "max"
          ]
        },
        "tooltip": {
          "mode": "multi"
        }
      }
    },
    {
      "type": "timeseries",
      "title": "Negocio: inicios de sesion rechazados / min",
      "description": "Un salto aqui sin saltos de 5xx suele ser ataque o fallo de credenciales, no caida tecnica.",
      "id": 12,
      "datasource": {
        "type": "prometheus",
        "uid": "prometheus"
      },
      "gridPos": {
        "h": 8,
        "w": 8,
        "x": 16,
        "y": 15
      },
      "targets": [
        {
          "expr": "sum(rate(logins_rechazados_total{namespace=\"sa-p8\"}[5m])) * 60",
          "legendFormat": "rechazados/min",
          "refId": "A",
          "datasource": {
            "type": "prometheus",
            "uid": "prometheus"
          }
        }
      ],
      "fieldConfig": {
        "defaults": {
          "unit": "none",
          "custom": {
            "lineWidth": 2,
            "fillOpacity": 8
          },
          "min": 0
        },
        "overrides": []
      },
      "options": {
        "legend": {
          "displayMode": "table",
          "placement": "bottom",
          "calcs": [
            "lastNotNull",
            "max"
          ]
        },
        "tooltip": {
          "mode": "multi"
        }
      }
    },
    {
      "type": "row",
      "title": "4 · Errores — ¿qué está fallando?",
      "collapsed": false,
      "gridPos": {
        "h": 1,
        "w": 24,
        "x": 0,
        "y": 23
      },
      "id": 13,
      "panels": []
    },
    {
      "type": "timeseries",
      "title": "Tasa de error 5xx por servicio",
      "description": "Compare con el SLO: el borde (api-gateway) es lo que ve el usuario; el servicio con mas error es el sospechoso.",
      "id": 14,
      "datasource": {
        "type": "prometheus",
        "uid": "prometheus"
      },
      "gridPos": {
        "h": 8,
        "w": 12,
        "x": 0,
        "y": 24
      },
      "targets": [
        {
          "expr": "sum by (app) (rate(http_requests_total{namespace=\"sa-p8\",app=~\"api-gateway|auth|solicitudes\",route!~\"/health.*|/metrics\",status_code=~\"5..\"}[5m])) / sum by (app) (rate(http_requests_total{namespace=\"sa-p8\",app=~\"api-gateway|auth|solicitudes\",route!~\"/health.*|/metrics\"}[5m]))",
          "legendFormat": "{{app}}",
          "refId": "A",
          "datasource": {
            "type": "prometheus",
            "uid": "prometheus"
          }
        }
      ],
      "fieldConfig": {
        "defaults": {
          "unit": "percentunit",
          "custom": {
            "lineWidth": 2,
            "fillOpacity": 8
          },
          "min": 0
        },
        "overrides": []
      },
      "options": {
        "legend": {
          "displayMode": "table",
          "placement": "bottom",
          "calcs": [
            "lastNotNull",
            "max"
          ]
        },
        "tooltip": {
          "mode": "multi"
        }
      }
    },
    {
      "type": "timeseries",
      "title": "5xx por ruta (req/s)",
      "description": "Acota el sintoma a una ruta concreta antes de ir a las trazas.",
      "id": 15,
      "datasource": {
        "type": "prometheus",
        "uid": "prometheus"
      },
      "gridPos": {
        "h": 8,
        "w": 12,
        "x": 12,
        "y": 24
      },
      "targets": [
        {
          "expr": "sum by (app, route) (rate(http_requests_total{namespace=\"sa-p8\",app=~\"api-gateway|auth|solicitudes\",route!~\"/health.*|/metrics\",status_code=~\"5..\"}[5m]))",
          "legendFormat": "{{app}} {{route}}",
          "refId": "A",
          "datasource": {
            "type": "prometheus",
            "uid": "prometheus"
          }
        }
      ],
      "fieldConfig": {
        "defaults": {
          "unit": "reqps",
          "custom": {
            "lineWidth": 2,
            "fillOpacity": 8
          },
          "min": 0
        },
        "overrides": []
      },
      "options": {
        "legend": {
          "displayMode": "table",
          "placement": "bottom",
          "calcs": [
            "lastNotNull",
            "max"
          ]
        },
        "tooltip": {
          "mode": "multi"
        }
      }
    },
    {
      "type": "row",
      "title": "5 · Saturación — ¿qué tan cerca del límite?",
      "collapsed": false,
      "gridPos": {
        "h": 1,
        "w": 24,
        "x": 0,
        "y": 32
      },
      "id": 16,
      "panels": []
    },
    {
      "type": "timeseries",
      "title": "CPU usada / límite por pod",
      "description": "Cerca de 100 % el pod se estrangula (throttling) y la latencia sube sin que haya errores.",
      "id": 17,
      "datasource": {
        "type": "prometheus",
        "uid": "prometheus"
      },
      "gridPos": {
        "h": 8,
        "w": 12,
        "x": 0,
        "y": 33
      },
      "targets": [
        {
          "expr": "sum by (pod) (rate(container_cpu_usage_seconds_total{namespace=\"sa-p8\",container=~\"api-gateway|auth|solicitudes\"}[5m])) / sum by (pod) (kube_pod_container_resource_limits{namespace=\"sa-p8\",resource=\"cpu\",container=~\"api-gateway|auth|solicitudes\"})",
          "legendFormat": "{{pod}}",
          "refId": "A",
          "datasource": {
            "type": "prometheus",
            "uid": "prometheus"
          }
        }
      ],
      "fieldConfig": {
        "defaults": {
          "unit": "percentunit",
          "custom": {
            "lineWidth": 2,
            "fillOpacity": 8
          },
          "min": 0
        },
        "overrides": []
      },
      "options": {
        "legend": {
          "displayMode": "table",
          "placement": "bottom",
          "calcs": [
            "lastNotNull",
            "max"
          ]
        },
        "tooltip": {
          "mode": "multi"
        }
      }
    },
    {
      "type": "timeseries",
      "title": "Memoria usada / límite por pod",
      "description": "Cerca de 100 % anticipa OOMKilled y reinicios.",
      "id": 18,
      "datasource": {
        "type": "prometheus",
        "uid": "prometheus"
      },
      "gridPos": {
        "h": 8,
        "w": 12,
        "x": 12,
        "y": 33
      },
      "targets": [
        {
          "expr": "sum by (pod) (container_memory_working_set_bytes{namespace=\"sa-p8\",container=~\"api-gateway|auth|solicitudes\"}) / sum by (pod) (kube_pod_container_resource_limits{namespace=\"sa-p8\",resource=\"memory\",container=~\"api-gateway|auth|solicitudes\"})",
          "legendFormat": "{{pod}}",
          "refId": "A",
          "datasource": {
            "type": "prometheus",
            "uid": "prometheus"
          }
        }
      ],
      "fieldConfig": {
        "defaults": {
          "unit": "percentunit",
          "custom": {
            "lineWidth": 2,
            "fillOpacity": 8
          },
          "min": 0
        },
        "overrides": []
      },
      "options": {
        "legend": {
          "displayMode": "table",
          "placement": "bottom",
          "calcs": [
            "lastNotNull",
            "max"
          ]
        },
        "tooltip": {
          "mode": "multi"
        }
      }
    },
    {
      "type": "row",
      "title": "Del síntoma a la causa — registros de error (clic en trace_id para abrir la traza)",
      "collapsed": false,
      "gridPos": {
        "h": 1,
        "w": 24,
        "x": 0,
        "y": 41
      },
      "id": 19,
      "panels": []
    },
    {
      "type": "logs",
      "title": "Errores recientes de los tres servicios",
      "description": "LogQL: registros JSON con level=error. El campo trace_id enlaza a Tempo.",
      "id": 20,
      "datasource": {
        "type": "loki",
        "uid": "loki"
      },
      "gridPos": {
        "h": 10,
        "w": 24,
        "x": 0,
        "y": 42
      },
      "targets": [
        {
          "expr": "{service_name=~\"api-gateway|auth|solicitudes\"} | json | level=~\"error|ERROR\"",
          "refId": "A",
          "datasource": {
            "type": "loki",
            "uid": "loki"
          }
        }
      ],
      "options": {
        "showTime": true,
        "wrapLogMessage": true,
        "enableLogDetails": true,
        "sortOrder": "Descending",
        "dedupStrategy": "none"
      }
    }
  ]
}